<https://threadbiz.ai/journey/neighborhood-table-001/entry-011> <https://threadbiz.ai/ontology#caption> "This week's menu brings together a few cherished connections and ingredients! We're making dumplings in a broth crafted from saved chicken bones, with carrots and fresh parsley from Rosa's farm stand a few blocks over. It’s all seasoned with dried basil, and we're so glad Dave's daughter asked for dumplings! Please pre-order for this week's drop." .
